<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>iFrame Demo</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; background: #f0f0f0; }
    h2 { color: #333; }
    iframe { border: 2px solid #333; border-radius: 6px; display: block; margin-bottom: 30px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h2>1. Embedding a Map (OpenStreetMap)</h2>
  <iframe
    src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=78.9,21.05,79.25,21.25&layer=mapnik"
    width="600" height="300" title="Map">
  </iframe>

  <h2>2. Embedding an External Page (Wikipedia)</h2>
  <iframe
    src="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/HTML"
    width="600" height="300" title="Wikipedia">
  </iframe>

  <h2>3. Embedding a YouTube Video</h2>
  <iframe
    src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ"
    width="600" height="300" title="YouTube"
    allowfullscreen>
  </iframe>

</body>
</html>
